</tr>
<tr>
<td>Template Management</td>
<td>Define template variables</td>
<td>Store and render templates</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Delivery Tracking</td>
<td>Display status in UI</td>
<td>Track delivery, opens, clicks</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Bounce Handling</td>
<td>Process webhook events</td>
<td>Detect bounces and report</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Unsubscribe Management</td>
<td>Update user preferences</td>
<td>Process unsubscribe requests</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Analytics</td>
<td>Dashboard visualization</td>
<td>Collect engagement metrics</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<h3>Key Metrics</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Email Volume</strong>: 1.2M emails/year (~50,000/day peak)</li>
<li><strong>Delivery Rate</strong>: 99.2% (industry average: 95%)</li>
<li><strong>Open Rate</strong>: 42% (industry average: 21%)</li>
<li><strong>Click-Through Rate</strong>: 8.5% (industry average: 2.6%)</li>
<li><strong>Bounce Rate</strong>: 0.8% (target: &lt;2%)</li>
<li><strong>Spam Complaint Rate</strong>: 0.02% (target: &lt;0.1%)</li>
<li><strong>API Call Volume</strong>: ~65,000 calls/month (800 req/min peak)</li>
<li><strong>SLA</strong>: 99.9% uptime, &lt;500ms response time</li>
</ul>
